# Vendored AI-harness tooling, installed by `npx impeccable install` and by the
# codex plugin. Three near-identical copies of the same skill (~8.7 MB, 373
# files) that are reproducible from the installer, so they are deliberately not
# history. The project's OWN records — app/DESIGN.md, app/PRODUCT.md and the
# design.json sidecar — are tracked.
